## Interface: 16001
## Title: Waylaid Shopper
## Notes: Ranks every Waylaid Crate by the cheapest way to fill it from Auctionator's scan prices, builds one shopping list, and walks it at the Auction House with a Buy Next button (one click per purchase, price caps and a budget).
